TheĠtaskĠisĠtoĠproveĠthatĠadditionĠofĠnaturalĠnumbersĠisĠcommutative,Ġi.e.,Ġ`aĠ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+Ġa`.ĠTheĠgivenĠproofĠoutlineĠusesĠinductionĠonĠ`a`ĠwithĠtheĠinductionĠhypothesisĠ`ih`.ĊĊ###ĠAnalysisĠofĠtheĠGivenĠProofĠOutlineĊĊ1.Ġ**BaseĠCaseĠ(`|Ġzero`)**:ĊĠĠĠ-ĠTheĠbaseĠcaseĠisĠwhenĠ`aĠ=Ġ0`.ĠTheĠproofĠusesĠ`simp`,ĠwhichĠlikelyĠsimplifiesĠtheĠgoalĠ`0Ġ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+Ġ0`ĠtoĠ`bĠ=Ġb`,ĠwhichĠisĠtrueĠbyĠreflexivity.ĠThisĠmakesĠsenseĠbecauseĠ`0Ġ+Ġb`ĠisĠjustĠ`b`ĠbyĠtheĠdefinitionĠofĠaddition,ĠandĠ`bĠ+Ġ0`ĠisĠalsoĠ`b`Ġ(asĠshownĠinĠtheĠexampleĠtheoremĠ`add_zero_triv`).ĊĊ2.Ġ**InductiveĠStepĠ(`|ĠsuccĠaĠih`)**:ĊĠĠĠ-ĠTheĠinductiveĠstepĠisĠwhenĠ`aĠ=ĠsuccĠa'`.ĠTheĠgoalĠhereĠisĠtoĠproveĠ`(succĠa)Ġ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+Ġ(succĠa)`.ĊĠĠĠ-ĠTheĠhintĠ`[Nat.succ_add,Ġih]`ĠsuggestsĠusingĠtheĠlemmaĠ`Nat.succ_add`,ĠwhichĠstatesĠthatĠ`succĠxĠ+ĠyĠ=ĠxĠ+Ġ(succĠy)`.ĠApplyingĠthisĠtoĠtheĠleftĠsideĠofĠtheĠgoal:ĊĠĠĠĠĠ-Ġ`(succĠa)Ġ+Ġb`ĠbecomesĠ`aĠ+Ġ(succĠb)`.ĊĠĠĠ-ĠTheĠinductionĠhypothesisĠ`ih`ĠisĠ`aĠ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+Ġa`.ĊĠĠĠ-ĠNow,ĠtheĠgoalĠisĠ`aĠ+Ġ(succĠb)Ġ=ĠbĠ+Ġ(succĠa)`.ĠToĠconnectĠthis,ĠweĠcanĠrewriteĠtheĠleftĠsideĠusingĠ`ih`ĠifĠpossible,ĠbutĠweĠneedĠaĠwayĠtoĠgetĠ`(succĠa)Ġ+Ġb`ĠintoĠaĠformĠwhereĠweĠcanĠapplyĠtheĠinductionĠhypothesisĠorĠotherĠlemmas.ĊĊ###ĠMissingĠBlockĠinĠtheĠProofĊĊTheĠmissingĠpartĠisĠtheĠstepĠwhereĠweĠtransitionĠfromĠtheĠinductionĠhypothesisĠtoĠtheĠgoal.ĠSpecifically,ĠafterĠapplyingĠ`Nat.succ_add`ĠtoĠtheĠleftĠside,ĠweĠhaveĠ`aĠ+Ġ(succĠb)`ĠonĠtheĠleft,ĠandĠtheĠgoalĠisĠtoĠrelateĠthisĠtoĠ`bĠ+Ġ(succĠa)`.ĊĊOneĠwayĠtoĠproceedĠisĠto:Ċ1.ĠUseĠ`Nat.succ_add`ĠtoĠrewriteĠ`(succĠa)Ġ+Ġb`ĠasĠ`aĠ+Ġ(succĠb)`.Ċ2.ĠUseĠtheĠinductionĠhypothesisĠ`ih`Ġ(`aĠ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+Ġa`)ĠtoĠrewriteĠ`aĠ+Ġ(succĠb)`ĠasĠ`bĠ+Ġ(succĠa)`,ĠbutĠthisĠisn'tĠdirectlyĠapplicable.Ċ3.ĠAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠweĠneedĠtoĠpermuteĠtheĠtermsĠtoĠmatchĠtheĠinductionĠhypothesis.ĠThisĠsuggestsĠthatĠweĠmightĠneedĠtoĠapplyĠtheĠinductionĠhypothesisĠtoĠaĠpermutedĠversionĠofĠtheĠterms.ĊĊAĠbetterĠapproachĠisĠtoĠuseĠ`cong`ĠorĠ`rw`ĠtoĠmanuallyĠapplyĠtheĠinductionĠhypothesisĠwhereĠneeded.ĠHowever,ĠtheĠhintĠ`[Nat.succ_add,Ġih]`ĠsuggestsĠthatĠ`simp`ĠcanĠhandleĠthisĠifĠgivenĠtheĠrightĠhints.ĊĊGivenĠthat,ĠtheĠmissingĠblockĠisĠlikelyĠ`simpĠ[Nat.succ_add,Ġih]`,ĠwhichĠshouldĠhandleĠtheĠrewritingĠandĠuseĠtheĠinductionĠhypothesisĠtoĠproveĠtheĠinductiveĠstep.ĊĊ###ĠVerificationĊĊLet'sĠverifyĠtheĠstepsĠforĠtheĠinductiveĠcase:Ċ-ĠOriginalĠgoal:Ġ`(succĠa)Ġ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+Ġ(succĠa)`Ċ-ĠAfterĠ`Nat.succ_add`:Ġ`aĠ+Ġ(succĠb)Ġ=ĠbĠ+Ġ(succĠa)`Ċ-ĠNow,ĠweĠcanĠapplyĠtheĠinductionĠhypothesisĠ`ih`Ġ(`aĠ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+Ġa`)ĠbutĠitĠdoesn'tĠdirectlyĠmatch.ĠHowever,ĠperhapsĠ`simp`ĠcanĠuseĠadditionalĠlemmasĠorĠhintsĠtoĠpermuteĠtheĠterms.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠweĠmightĠneedĠtoĠaddĠmoreĠhints,ĠlikeĠ`Nat.add_succ`ĠorĠ`Nat.succ_add`,ĠtoĠallowĠ`simp`ĠtoĠrearrangeĠtheĠterms.ĊĊGivenĠthatĠtheĠhintĠincludesĠ`Nat.succ_add`ĠandĠ`ih`,ĠitĠseemsĠthatĠ`simp`ĠisĠexpectedĠtoĠhandleĠtheĠrest.ĠIfĠthisĠdoesn'tĠwork,ĠweĠmightĠneedĠtoĠexplicitlyĠapplyĠtheĠinductionĠhypothesisĠusingĠ`rw`ĠorĠ`cong`.ĊĊHowever,ĠsinceĠtheĠhintĠisĠalreadyĠprovided,ĠtheĠmissingĠblockĠisĠlikelyĠjustĠ`simpĠ[Nat.succ_add,Ġih]`.ĊĊButĠlookingĠatĠtheĠstructure,ĠtheĠproofĠisĠdividedĠintoĠtheĠbaseĠcaseĠandĠtheĠinductiveĠstep.ĠTheĠmissingĠblockĠisĠtheĠinductiveĠstep,ĠsoĠtheĠcodeĠshouldĠbe:ĊĊ```leanĊtheoremĠadd_commĠ(aĠbĠ:ĠâĦķ)Ġ:ĠaĠ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+ĠaĠ:=ĠbyĊĠĠinductionĠaĠwithĠaĠihĠ=>ĊĠĠ|ĠzeroĠ=>ĠsimpĊĠĠ|ĠsuccĠaĠihĠ=>ĠsimpĠ[Nat.succ_add,Ġih]Ċ```ĊĊWait,ĠtheĠoriginalĠcodeĠhasĠ`|ĠzeroĠ=>Ġsimp`ĠandĠ`|ĠsuccĠaĠihĠ=>ĠsimpĠ[Nat.succ_add,Ġih]`,ĠsoĠtheĠmissingĠblockĠisĠtheĠentireĠproof,ĠbutĠtheĠuserĠhasĠprovidedĠsomeĠparts.ĠTheĠmissingĠpartĠisĠtheĠlineĠthatĠcompletesĠtheĠproof,ĠwhichĠisĠalreadyĠgiven
