TheĠtaskĠisĠtoĠproveĠthatĠadditionĠisĠcommutativeĠforĠnaturalĠnumbers,Ġi.e.,Ġ`aĠ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+Ġa`ĠforĠanyĠ`a,ĠbĠ:ĠâĦķ`.ĠTheĠproofĠisĠstructuredĠwithĠanĠinductionĠonĠ`a`,ĠandĠtheĠmissingĠblockĠisĠtheĠbaseĠcaseĠwhereĠ`aĠ=Ġ0`.ĊĊLetĠmeĠthinkĠaboutĠhowĠadditionĠworksĠforĠnaturalĠnumbers.ĠAdditionĠisĠdefinedĠrecursively,ĠandĠcommutativityĠisĠaĠfundamentalĠproperty.ĠHere'sĠtheĠgeneralĠstructureĠofĠtheĠproof:ĊĊ1.ĠTheĠinductionĠhypothesisĠisĠ`a`.Ċ2.ĠTheĠinductionĠstepĠsplitsĠintoĠtwoĠcases:ĠtheĠbaseĠcaseĠwhenĠ`aĠ=Ġ0`,ĠandĠtheĠinductiveĠstepĠwhenĠ`a`ĠisĠaĠsuccessorĠ(i.e.,Ġ`succĠa`).Ċ3.ĠInĠtheĠgivenĠcode,ĠtheĠinductiveĠstepĠisĠalreadyĠprovided:Ġ`succĠaĠihĠ=>ĠsimpĠ[Nat.succ_add,Ġih]`.ĠThisĠsuggestsĠthatĠtheĠbaseĠcaseĠisĠmissing.ĊĊForĠtheĠbaseĠcaseĠ(whenĠ`aĠ=Ġ0`),ĠweĠneedĠtoĠshowĠthatĠ`0Ġ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+Ġ0`.ĠSinceĠadditionĠisĠcommutative,Ġ`0Ġ+Ġb`ĠshouldĠequalĠ`bĠ+Ġ0`.ĠButĠhowĠdoĠweĠproveĠthis?ĊĊ-Ġ`0Ġ+Ġb`ĠisĠjustĠ`b`ĠbyĠtheĠdefinitionĠofĠadditionĠ(sinceĠaddingĠ0ĠleavesĠtheĠnumberĠunchanged).Ċ-Ġ`bĠ+Ġ0`ĠisĠalsoĠ`b`ĠbyĠtheĠsameĠreasoning.Ċ-ĠTherefore,Ġ`0Ġ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+Ġ0`,ĠsoĠ`0Ġ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+Ġ0`.ĊĊButĠhowĠdoĠweĠformalizeĠthisĠinĠLean?ĠWeĠcanĠuseĠ`rfl`Ġ(reflexivity)ĠifĠweĠcanĠunifyĠbothĠsides,ĠbutĠthatĠmightĠnotĠworkĠdirectly.ĠAlternatively,ĠweĠcanĠuseĠ`simp`ĠtoĠsimplifyĠbothĠsidesĠusingĠtheĠdefinitionĠofĠaddition.ĊĊInĠtheĠbaseĠcase,Ġ`0Ġ+Ġb`ĠisĠsimplifiedĠtoĠ`b`Ġ(byĠ`Nat.zero_add`),ĠandĠ`bĠ+Ġ0`ĠisĠalsoĠsimplifiedĠtoĠ`b`Ġ(byĠ`Nat.add_zero`).ĠThus,Ġ`simp`ĠshouldĠworkĠhereĠtoĠproveĠtheĠbaseĠcase.ĊĊSo,ĠtheĠmissingĠblockĠisĠlikelyĠsomethingĠthatĠsimplifiesĠtheĠbaseĠcase,ĠsuchĠas:Ċ```ĊĠĠsimpĠ[Nat.zero_add,ĠNat.add_zero]Ċ```ĊĊLetĠmeĠverifyĠthis:Ċ-ĠForĠ`0Ġ+Ġb`,Ġ`Nat.zero_add`ĠsaysĠthatĠ`0Ġ+ĠbĠ=Ġb`.Ċ-ĠForĠ`bĠ+Ġ0`,Ġ`Nat.add_zero`ĠsaysĠthatĠ`bĠ+Ġ0Ġ=Ġb`.Ċ-ĠThus,Ġ`simpĠ[Nat.zero_add,ĠNat.add_zero]`ĠshouldĠreduceĠbothĠsidesĠtoĠ`b`ĠandĠproveĠtheĠequalityĠinĠtheĠbaseĠcase.ĊĊSo,ĠtheĠmissingĠblockĠshouldĠbeĠ`simpĠ[Nat.zero_add,ĠNat.add_zero]`.ĊĊButĠwait,ĠtheĠgivenĠcodeĠalreadyĠhasĠ`simpĠ[Nat.succ_add,Ġih]`ĠinĠtheĠinductiveĠstep.ĠTheĠbaseĠcaseĠisĠtheĠfirstĠcaseĠinĠtheĠinduction,ĠsoĠtheĠmissingĠblockĠisĠtheĠbaseĠcaseĠproof.ĊĊThus,ĠtheĠcompletedĠproofĠbecomes:ĊĊ```leanĊtheoremĠadd_commĠ(aĠbĠ:ĠâĦķ)Ġ:ĠaĠ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+ĠaĠ:=ĠbyĊĠĠinductionĠaĠwithĊĠĠ|ĠzeroĠ=>ĠsimpĠ[Nat.zero_add,ĠNat.add_zero]ĊĠĠ|ĠsuccĠaĠihĠ=>ĠsimpĠ[Nat.succ_add,Ġih]Ċ```ĊĊLetĠmeĠdouble-checkĠthis:Ċ1.ĠBaseĠcaseĠ(`aĠ=Ġ0`):ĠWeĠwantĠtoĠproveĠ`0Ġ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+Ġ0`.ĊĠĠĠ-Ġ`Nat.zero_add`ĠsaysĠ`0Ġ+ĠbĠ=Ġb`.ĊĠĠĠ-Ġ`Nat.add_zero`ĠsaysĠ`bĠ+Ġ0Ġ=Ġb`.ĊĠĠĠ-ĠSoĠ`simp`ĠwithĠtheseĠtwoĠlemmasĠshouldĠwork.Ċ2.ĠInductiveĠstepĠ(`aĠ=ĠsuccĠa'`):ĠWeĠwantĠtoĠproveĠ`(succĠa')Ġ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+Ġ(succĠa')`ĠassumingĠ`a'Ġ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+Ġa'`.ĊĠĠĠ-Ġ`Nat.succ_add`ĠsaysĠ`(succĠa')Ġ+ĠbĠ=ĠsuccĠ(a'Ġ+Ġb)`.ĊĠĠĠ-ĠByĠtheĠinductionĠhypothesis,Ġ`a'Ġ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+Ġa'`,ĠsoĠ`(succĠa')Ġ+ĠbĠ=ĠsuccĠ(bĠ+Ġa')`.ĊĠĠĠ-ĠOnĠtheĠrightĠside,Ġ`bĠ+Ġ(succĠa')Ġ=ĠsuccĠ(bĠ+Ġa')`ĠbyĠ`Nat.add_succ`Ġ(orĠpossiblyĠ`Nat.succ_add`Ġagain,ĠdependingĠonĠhowĠit'sĠphrased).ĊĠĠĠ-ĠThus,ĠbothĠsidesĠbecomeĠ`succĠ(bĠ+Ġa')`,ĠandĠ`simp`ĠwithĠ`Nat.succ_add`ĠandĠtheĠinductionĠhypothesisĠshouldĠwork.ĊĊEverythingĠseemsĠtoĠfit.ĠSoĠtheĠmissingĠblockĠis:Ċ```ĊĠĠ|ĠzeroĠ=>ĠsimpĠ[Nat.zero_add,ĠNat.add_zero]Ċ```ĊĊThisĠshouldĠcompleteĠtheĠproofĠcorrectly.ĠTheĠ`simp`ĠtacticĠinĠtheĠbaseĠcaseĠwillĠsimplifyĠbothĠsidesĠtoĠ`b`,ĠprovingĠtheĠequality.<FIM_CODE>ĊĠĠ|ĠzeroĠ=>ĠsimpĠ[Nat.zero_add,ĠNat.add_zero]Ċ</F  | succ a ih => simp [Nat.succ_add, ih]
