ctiveĠstep.ĠTheĠbaseĠcaseĠisĠtheĠfirstĠcaseĠinĠtheĠinduction,ĠsoĠtheĠmissingĠblockĠisĠtheĠbaseĠcaseĠproof.ĊĊThus,ĠtheĠcompletedĠproofĠbecomes:ĊĊ```leanĊtheoremĠadd_commĠ(aĠbĠ:ĠâĦķ)Ġ:ĠaĠ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+ĠaĠ:=ĠbyĊĠĠinductionĠaĠwithĊĠĠ|ĠzeroĠ=>ĠsimpĠ[Nat.zero_add,ĠNat.add_zero]ĊĠĠ|ĠsuccĠaĠihĠ=>ĠsimpĠ[Nat.succ_add,Ġih]Ċ```ĊĊLetĠmeĠdouble-checkĠthis:Ċ1.ĠBaseĠcaseĠ(`aĠ=Ġ0`):ĠWeĠwantĠtoĠproveĠ`0Ġ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+Ġ0`.ĊĠĠĠ-Ġ`Nat.zero_add`ĠsaysĠ`0Ġ+ĠbĠ=Ġb`.ĊĠĠĠ-Ġ`Nat.add_zero`ĠsaysĠ`bĠ+Ġ0Ġ=Ġb`.ĊĠĠĠ-ĠSoĠ`simp`ĠwithĠtheseĠtwoĠlemmasĠshouldĠwork.Ċ2.ĠInductiveĠstepĠ(`aĠ=ĠsuccĠa'`):ĠWeĠwantĠtoĠproveĠ`(succĠa')Ġ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+Ġ(succĠa')`ĠassumingĠ`a'Ġ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+Ġa'`.ĊĠĠĠ-Ġ`Nat.succ_add`ĠsaysĠ`(succĠa')Ġ+ĠbĠ=ĠsuccĠ(a'Ġ+Ġb)`.ĊĠĠĠ-ĠByĠtheĠinductionĠhypothesis,Ġ`a'Ġ+ĠbĠ=ĠbĠ+Ġa'`,ĠsoĠ`(succĠa')Ġ+ĠbĠ=ĠsuccĠ(bĠ+Ġa')`.ĊĠĠĠ-ĠOnĠtheĠrightĠside,Ġ`bĠ+Ġ(succĠa')Ġ=ĠsuccĠ(bĠ+Ġa')`ĠbyĠ`Nat.add_succ`Ġ(orĠpossiblyĠ`Nat.succ_add`Ġagain,ĠdependingĠonĠhowĠit'sĠphrased).ĊĠĠĠ-ĠThus,ĠbothĠsidesĠbecomeĠ`succĠ(bĠ+Ġa')`,ĠandĠ`simp`ĠwithĠ`Nat.succ_add`ĠandĠtheĠinductionĠhypothesisĠshouldĠwork.ĊĊEverythingĠseemsĠtoĠfit.ĠSoĠtheĠmissingĠblockĠis:Ċ```ĊĠĠ|ĠzeroĠ=>ĠsimpĠ[Nat.zero_add,ĠNat.add_zero]Ċ```ĊĊThisĠshouldĠcompleteĠtheĠproofĠcorrectly.ĠTheĠ`simp`ĠtacticĠinĠtheĠbaseĠcaseĠwillĠsimplifyĠbothĠsidesĠtoĠ`b`,ĠprovingĠtheĠequality.<FIM_CODE>ĊĠĠ|ĠzeroĠ=>ĠsimpĠ[Nat.zero_add,ĠNat.add_zero]Ċ</F
